r Bash", "description_zh": "攻击时有一定概率眩晕并击退敌方单位。重击的伤害值为移动速度的一定百分比。", "description_en": "Gives a chance to stun and knockback an enemy unit on an attack. Deals a percentage of movement speed as damage.", "notes_zh": ["不与碎颅锤叠加。", "破坏会使攻击触发巨力重击失效。暗影冲刺或幽冥一击还是会施加巨力重击。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "击退效果提升。如果击退的敌人又撞到了一个敌人，这个敌人也会被重击（非英雄单位只受到%cascading_bashes_creep_penalty%%%伤害），并且原目标再次受到%cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier%%%的巨力重击伤害。", "en": "Increases knockback. If a knocked-back enemy collides with another enemy, the second enemy is bashed (creeps only receive %cascading_bashes_creep_penalty%%% damage), and the original target takes %cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier%%% of Greater Bash's damage again."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["chance_pct", "bonus_chance_pct", "bonus_chance_duration", "damage", "duration", "knockback_duration", "cascading_bash_cooldown", "cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier", "cascading_bashes_creep_penalty", "cascading_bashes_nether_strike_additional_cooldown", "cascading_bashes_hero_hitbox", "cascading_bashes_creep_hitbox", "knockback_distance", "knockback_height", "bonus_knockback_multiplier"]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_planar_pocket", "name_zh": "裂魂人·位面空洞", "name_en": "Planar Pocket", "description_zh": "巴拉森获得魔法抗性，并扭曲选定英雄附近的现实，使敌方英雄施放的任意指向性技能转向裂魂人。可以对友方和敌方英雄施放，但是只有裂魂人的敌人施放的技能才会转向。", "description_en": "Barathrum gains magic resistance and distorts reality around the selected hero, making any unit-targeted spells cast by enemy heroes get redirected towards Spirit Breaker. Can be cast on both allied and enemy heroes, but only spells cast by enemies of Spirit Breaker will be redirected.", "notes_zh": ["如果裂魂人和目标之间的距离超过%break_distance%，位面空洞效果会停止。"], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "duration", "magic_resistance", "break_distance", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_bull_rush", "name_zh": "裂魂人·神行太保", "name_en": "Empowe