定位目标单位的追踪导弹。导弹发射后持续增加飞行速度，击中目标时造成伤害及眩晕。敌方单位可在导弹接近前将其击落。", "description_en": "Fires a homing missile to seek the targeted enemy unit. The missile gains speed over time, dealing damage and stunning when it impacts the target. Enemy units can destroy the missile before it reaches its target.", "notes_zh": ["防御塔对导弹造成半额伤害。", "准星效果仅对队友可见。", "导弹会跟随并击中隐身单位。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "追踪导弹现在从施放%shard_delay%秒后开始不断发射%shard_radius%作用范围的火箭弹幕。火箭弹幕优先以追踪导弹的目标为目标。", "en": "Homing Missiles now constantly fires the current level of Rocket Barrage in a %shard_radius% area of effect after %shard_delay% second of being cast. This Rocket Barrage prioritizes the Homing Missile target."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hits_to_kill_tooltip", "tower_hits_to_kill_tooltip", "stun_duration", "attack_speed_bonus_pct", "hit_damage", "max_distance", "pre_flight_time", "hero_damage", "speed", "acceleration", "enemy_vision_time", "shard_delay", "shard_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_flak_cannon", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·高射火炮", "name_en": "Flak Cannon", "description_zh": "矮人直升机的攻击会击中目标周围一定范围内的所有敌人，持续一定次数的攻击。只有主要目标会受到致命一击等攻击特效。持续%abilityduration%秒或攻击次数耗尽。", "description_en": "Gyrocopter's attacks hit all enemy units in an area around it for a limited number of attacks.  Only the main target of attacks will receive attack bonuses such as Critical Strike.  Lasts %abilityduration% seconds or until the attacks are used.", "notes_zh": ["对主目标的攻击距离没有改变。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "max_attacks", "projectile_speed", "bonus_damage", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_afterburner", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·加力燃烧器", "name_en": "Afterburner", "description_zh": "矮人直升机通过攻击或技能对敌人造成伤害后，在短时间内获得移动速度提升。", "description_en": "Gyrocopter gains movement speed for a short duration after damaging an enemy with his attacks or abilities.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["bonus_movespeed_duration", "bonus_movement_speed_per_hit", "bonus_movement_speed_per_hit_creep"]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_side_gunner_spawn_ability", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·侧翼机枪", "name_en": "Side Gunner", "description_zh": "矮人直升机获得侧翼机枪，每%sidegunner_fire_rate%秒对矮人直升机附近%AbilityCastRange%范围内的敌方单位发动攻击。优先攻击范围内最远的单位。", "description_en": "Gyrocopter gains a Side Gunner that attacks enemy units in a %AbilityCastRange% unit radius every %sidegunner_fire_rate%s with his attack. Prioritizes furthest unit away within its range.", "notes_zh": ["即使矮人直升机被控制，侧翼机枪也能攻击。"], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["double_target", "sidegunner_fire_rate", "AbilityCastRange"]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_call_down", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·召唤飞弹", "name_en": "Call Down", "description_zh": "召唤%total_strikes%波防空导弹，对目标区域内的敌方单位造成减速和伤害。每次打击与上一次间隔%strike_separation%距离。", "description_en": "Call down %total_strikes% aerial missile strikes that slow and damage enemy units in a target area. Each strike is %strike_separation% distance from the previous one.", "notes_zh": ["视觉指示范围仅对队友可见。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["slow_duration", "slow", "damage", "radius", "missile_delay_tooltip", "strike_delay", "total_strikes", "strike_separation", "tracking_missile_damage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_acid_spray", "name_zh": "炼金术士·酸性喷雾", "name_en": "Acid Spray", "description_zh": "向目标区域喷洒高压酸雾。穿过受污染地带的敌人每秒会受到物理伤害，同时护甲被削弱。", "description_en": "Sprays high-pressure acid across a target area. Enemy units who step across the contaminated terrain take damage per second and have their armor reduced.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "duration", "damage", "armor_reduction", "armor_allies", "tick_rate", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_unstable_concoction", "name_zh": "炼金术士·不稳定化合物", "name_en": "Unstable Concoction", "description_zh": "炼金术士调制一瓶不稳定的化合物，投向敌方英雄，对爆炸点周边范围的单位造成伤害并眩晕。调制的时间越久，伤害越大，眩晕时间也越长。炼金术士在调制期间获得移动速度加成。调制%brew_time%秒后达到最大伤害量和最长眩晕时间。然而，若%brew_explosion%秒后未扔出药剂，则会在炼金术士自己手中爆炸。", "description_en": "Alchemist brews up an unstable concoction that he can throw at an enemy hero, to stun and deal damage in an area around the explosion. The longer the concoction brews, the more damage it deals and the longer the stun. Alchemist is faster while charging the concoction. After %brew_time% seconds, the brew reaches its maximum damage and stun time. However, after %brew_explosion% seconds, the concoction will explode on Alchemist himself if not thrown.", "notes_zh": ["摇制开始后，本技能替换为投掷不稳定化合物。炼金术士在摇制期间可以像平常一样移动和攻击。", "炼金术士的头顶会有倒计时，提示剩余的摇制时间。倒计时对敌人可见。", "可以用此技能将自己反补。", "不稳定化合物无法被躲避，并且不稳定化合物被掷出后会停止调制。", "不稳定化合物的爆炸会对英雄和非英雄单位造成伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["brew_time", "brew_explosion", "min_stun", "max_stun", "max_damage", "radius", "move_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_corrosive_weaponry", "name_zh": "炼金术士·腐蚀兵械", "name_en": "Corrosive Weaponry", "description_zh": "炼金术士使他的武器浸满强酸，对击中的敌人施加可叠加的减速和基础攻击力降低效果。\n\n每次攻击施加%stacks_per_attack%层叠加效果。不稳定化合物每调制1秒施加%one_tooltip%层叠加效果。", "description_en": "Alchemist coats his weapons and empowers his spells with an acid that applies a stacking slow and base attack damage reduction to enemies hit.\n\nAttacks apply %stacks_per_attack% stacks. Unstable Concoction applies %one_tooltip% stack per second of brew time.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["max_stacks", "debuff_duration", "slow_per_stack", "attack_dmg_per_stack", "stacks_per_attack", "one_tooltip"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_berserk_potion", "name_zh": "炼金术士·狂暴药剂", "name_en": "Berserk Potion", "description_zh": "炼金术士向友军目标扔出一瓶药剂，施加弱驱散效果，并提供攻击速度、移动速度和生命恢复。驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Alchemist throws a potion at an ally, applying a basic dispel and giving them attack speed, movement speed and HP regen.DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "attack_speed", "hp_regen", "projectile_speed", "move_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_goblins_greed", "name_zh": "炼金术士·贪魔的贪婪", "name_en": "Greevil's Greed", "description_zh": "炼金术士将敌人的尸体和赏金神符转化成额外的金币。炼金术士每杀死一个单位，就能获得基础额外金钱和附加额外金钱。如果炼金术士在接下来%duration%秒内又杀死了一个单位，获得了黄金，那么他所获得的附加额外金钱将有一定幅度的增加。另外，赏金神符将提供成倍金钱。", "description_en": "Alchemist synthesizes additional gold from his enemies and bounty runes. With each kill, Alchemist earns base bonus gold and extra bonus gold. If Alchemist kills another unit which yields gold within the next %duration% seconds, an additional instance of Extra Bonus Gold is added to the total. Additionally, causes bounty runes to yield more gold.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "炼金术士熔铸阿哈利姆神杖并让一位友方英雄获得所有神杖升级效果。炼金术士每送出一把神杖都将获得%scepter_bonus_damage%点攻击力加成，贪魔的贪婪的基础和最高金钱增加%bonus_gold_per_scepter%。", "en": "Alchemist melts down Aghanim's Scepter to grant an allied hero all Aghanim's Scepter upgrades. Alchemist will gain bonus %scepter_bonus_damage% damage and %bonus_gold_per_scepter% additional base and max Greevil's Greed Extra Gold for each melted Scepter."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["duration", "bonus_gold", "bonus_gold_tooltip", "bonus_bonus_gold", "bonus_gold_per_scepter", "bounty_multiplier", "damage", "bonus_gold_cap", "bonus_gold_cap_tooltip", "scepter_bonus_damage", "scepter_bonus_damage_tooltip", "scepter_spell_amp", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_chemical_rage", "name_zh": "炼金术士·化学狂暴", "name_en": "Chemical Rage", "description_zh": "炼金术士诱发他的食人魔同伴进入化学狂暴，降低攻击间隔，提高移动速度和生命恢复。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Alchemist causes his Ogre to enter a chemically induced rage, reducing base attack cooldown and increasing movement speed and health regeneration.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["拥有%transformation_time%秒的变身时间，可以用来躲避攻击和技能弹道以及眩晕技能。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "transformation_time", "base_attack_time", "bonus_health_regen", "bonus_movespeed", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "invoker_quas", "name_zh": "祈求者·冰", "name_en": "Quas", "description_zh": "允许祈求者掌控冰元素。每个活跃的冰元素会让祈求者获得生命恢复加成。每级冰被动提供额外力量。", "description_en": "Allows manipulation of ice elements. Active Quas instances imbue Invoker with bonus hp regeneration. Passively grants bonus strength per level of Quas.", "notes_zh": ["祈求者最多只有3个元素。", "不会打破隐身状态，而且可以在持续施法期间施放。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提供%scepter_bonus_levels%级当前和最高等级。", "en": "Grants %scepter_bonus_levels% current and max level."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_level", "hp_regen_per_instance", "upgrade_at_level", "strength_bonus", "scepter_bonus_levels", "facet_bonus_levels"]}]
